## CERBERUS — The Guardian Security Suite

This license covers the unified CERBERUS Security Suite monorepo and all three platform Guardians:

- **MacGuardianWatchdog** (`MacGuardianWatchdog/`) — Native macOS security suite (SwiftUI + Bash/Python)
- **LinuxGuardianWatchdog** (`LinuxGuardianWatchdog/`) — Native Linux desktop security suite (GTK4/libadwaita + Python/Bash)
- **WindowsGuardianWatchdog** (`WindowsGuardianWatchdog/`) — Native Windows security suite (WinUI 3 / .NET 8)
- **CERBERUS Web Portal & Shared Schemas** (`src/`, `shared/`)

Third-party tools invoked by the Guardians (not bundled, installed separately via your OS or package manager) retain their own licenses (e.g., ClamAV GPL-2.0, rkhunter GPL-2.0).
